  "reflectionText": "Zechariah cried: rejoice, daughter of Zion. Your King comes to you, righteous and having salvation, lowly and riding on a donkey, the foal of a donkey. Have you ever been told to rejoice for a King whose coming will be on a donkey, before he has yet ridden through your gate?"
